      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Set the LAS key in Settings > BytePlus. Remove owned source subtitles, translate speech and burn in styled subtitles. Set a writable TOS directory. Restoration adds charges and narrows input to 3 hours/4K. Repaired source is a separate shared output, not a per-language translation. ASS uses the subtitle style controls; SRT does not."
